<item>
<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-28T08:12:30.398Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 08:12:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have intensified attacks on Saudi targets, including a strike on the Jazan refinery that killed one worker and disrupted operations, and missile and drone launches over the Red Sea and western Yemen. Saudi forces responded with a strike in Taiz that killed eleven civilians, according to Houthi media. Iran denied involvement in a drone attack that killed two Italians in Kuwait. The Mecca pact’s collective defence promise is being discussed for possible implementation. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOODcxN1l0OUZvOThDcDhLbFpkQW9lTVBrZVkxLS1NTjkxUXdqZ2U0X0lLRWJsUUFwR0J2UmQxTnZSa201OHFjd1lSdnlLS3p2VkY5VndneHU5WW5qZVV4UWxZUElJTkNQTHgyRUpMYThTNGI5cUcySTJvRThCdnBCVlBsaFdoVWtkaGNsOWFsNTM0ckMxV05SeA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9QVFV5M2FCMHUxZzgwUzZObTFBZEJIWkJRaC1VSjVZYUpxNV82ZUN1Z1pOa1NrYzVPajloWDZ4b1hTWjdOaVBtTHBQMXo3MjNURkRZR3ZBSDV5RUVnTlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
</item>
